==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|вы-|рабо́тать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|вы́работать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-выработать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|вы́работать|pf|impf=выраба́тывать}}

# to [[make]], to [[manufacture]], to [[produce]]
# to [[cultivate]], to [[develop]], to [[form]] {{gloss|including certain qualities pertaining to a person}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́работать''' [[хара́ктер]]|'''to develop''' a character}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́работать''' [[в]] [[себе́]] [[терпе́ние]]|'''to develop''' patience in oneself}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''вы́работать''' [[обая́ние]]|'''to develop''' charm}}
# to [[exhaust]], to [[use up]] {{gloss|by using something to extreme or until it is not functional}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|1a+p|вы́работать}}

